{"id":31452,"date":"2023-10-02T12:19:52","date_gmt":"2023-10-02T16:19:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/?page_id=31452"},"modified":"2025-06-27T12:23:15","modified_gmt":"2025-06-27T16:23:15","slug":"lenire","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/lenire\/","title":{"rendered":"Find Relief from Tinnitus with Lenire"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block white-section-one is-layout-flow wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns lenire-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Lenire is an evidence-based treatment device proven to soothe tinnitus that can be used from the comfort of your home with assistance from qualified healthcare professionals. The device plays sounds from headphones and provides gentle pulses to the tongue via a Tonguetip, which retrains your brain and helps you pay less attention to your tinnitus.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dr. Alexandra Tarvin of Elevate Audiology was specifically chosen to introduce the Lenire system to South Carolina and the surrounding regions. Both Dr. Tarvin and Dr. Cioli have completed advanced, specialized training in tinnitus management and the Lenire system, working alongside some of the leading experts in the field.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As dispensing the Lenire device requires rigorous, specialized training, we are proud to offer this innovative treatment option to our qualifying patients, providing cutting-edge care to those seeking relief from tinnitus.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-023-1280x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-31485\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-023-1280x960.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-023-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-023-600x450.jpg 600w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-023.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns lenire-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"How Does Lenire Work? Lenire Mechanism of Action\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube-nocookie.com\/embed\/kZlU3-B_CbU?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Does Lenire Work?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Bluetooth headphones, which are provided, deliver customized sounds to activate the auditory nerve to the brain. The settings are customized by your healthcare professional.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The Tonguetip, specifically designed to treat tinnitus, sits comfortably in the closed mouth. Tiny electrodes on the Tonguetip deliver mild and safe energy pulses to the surface of the tip of the tongue.\u2028<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A lightweight handheld device controls the timing and intensity of the treatment. You can start, pause and resume the treatment session, adjust the volume of the sound, and adjust the level of the tongue stimulation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block grey-section-one is-layout-flow wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block-is-layout-flow\">\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">What Does the Research Say?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"669\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/real-world-data-iage-1280x669.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32201\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/real-world-data-iage-1280x669.png 1280w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/real-world-data-iage-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/real-world-data-iage-1536x803.png 1536w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/real-world-data-iage.png 2048w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/real-world-data-iage-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"grey-one-pgh\">Lenire is the first device of its kind to receive a grant of approval from the FDA to treat tinnitus. This follows a large-scale clinical trial designed to meet the FDA\u2019s requirements during which 83% of patients recommended Lenire for the treatment of tinnitus. The large-scale trial\u2019s results were consistent with real-world evidence from 204 patients.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"md0132-lenire-tent-a3-overview-video-36-seconds-en_0\" src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1035281763?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share\"><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block grey-section-two is-layout-flow wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block-is-layout-flow\">\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns lenire-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Can I Get Started?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are highly interested in Lenire, please contact our office. We will learn more about your needs and can schedule a proper evaluation including a hearing evaluation if you do not have complete and thorough results from an audiologist valid within the past 6 months.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If it is mutually decided you are a good fit for Lenire we will schedule a Lenire fitting and the appropriate follow-ups to begin your treatment plan. Some follow-up care can be completed via phone or telehealth.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-014-1280x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-31487\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-014-1280x960.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-014-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-014-600x450.jpg 600w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/lenire-014.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"New treatment for tinnitus patients\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube-nocookie.com\/embed\/oGX_cVijCjI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Good Morning America Features Lenire Patient<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-dynamic-spacer\" style=\"height:clamp(1rem, 3vw, 3rem);margin:0\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote grey-two-reviews is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path fill=\"#ffce31\" d=\"M62 25.2H39.1L32 3l-7.1 22.2H2l18.5 13.7l-7 22.1L32 47.3L50.5 61l-7.1-22.2z\"\/><\/svg> <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path fill=\"#ffce31\" d=\"M62 25.2H39.1L32 3l-7.1 22.2H2l18.5 13.7l-7 22.1L32 47.3L50.5 61l-7.1-22.2z\"\/><\/svg> <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path fill=\"#ffce31\" d=\"M62 25.2H39.1L32 3l-7.1 22.2H2l18.5 13.7l-7 22.1L32 47.3L50.5 61l-7.1-22.2z\"\/><\/svg> <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path fill=\"#ffce31\" d=\"M62 25.2H39.1L32 3l-7.1 22.2H2l18.5 13.7l-7 22.1L32 47.3L50.5 61l-7.1-22.2z\"\/><\/svg> <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path fill=\"#ffce31\" d=\"M62 25.2H39.1L32 3l-7.1 22.2H2l18.5 13.7l-7 22.1L32 47.3L50.5 61l-7.1-22.2z\"\/><\/svg><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>My journey with Elevate Audiology and Dr. Tarver began in December of 2023. I am a Tinnitus patient who was diagnosed in Early 2023. My local ENT doctor and audiologist suggested I get hearing aids with sound therapy. I got my hearing aids in May of 2023. I also started seeing a behavior therapist to try and develop coping skills to better handle my Tinnitus. The hearing aids did not seem to help much so I began seeking out other treatment methods. I discovered the Lenire device and did my research and decided I was willing to give it a try. At this point I was willing to try about anything, I spoke to my local audiologist, and they said they had heard of Lenire but was not interested in offering Lenire to its patients. I decided to seek out another audiologist who offered the Lenire device. I called three other clinics who offered the device. Two of the clinics did not seem to know much about Lenire and could not give me a firm price. Jamie with Elevate Audiology was very prompt in giving me a price was very knowledgeable and set me an appointment for 12\/22\/23.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We drove from out of state to meet with Dr Tarvin. On the day we came up Dr. Tarvin called in with the flu. However, since we had drove four hours, she set up a face time interview so her staff could go ahead and fit me for the Lenire device. My treatment with Lenire had been amazing. I have just completed the initial 12 week sessions and my Tinnitus score has dropped from 65 to 10. I still hear the noise but the tone has changed and my brain does not focus on the sounds as much. I would highly recommend Elevate Audiology and The Lenire program.<\/p>\n<cite>Google Review <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\"><path fill=\"#fff\" d=\"M44.59 4.21a63.28 63.28 0 0 0 4.33 120.9a67.6 67.6 0 0 0 32.36.35a57.13 57.13 0 0 0 25.9-13.46a57.44 57.44 0 0 0 16-26.26a74.3 74.3 0 0 0 1.61-33.58H65.27v24.69h34.47a29.72 29.72 0 0 1-12.66 19.52a36.2 36.2 0 0 1-13.93 5.5a41.3 41.3 0 0 1-15.1 0A37.2 37.2 0 0 1 44 95.74a39.3 39.3 0 0 1-14.5-19.42a38.3 38.3 0 0 1 0-24.63a39.25 39.25 0 0 1 9.18-14.91A37.17 37.17 0 0 1 76.13 27a34.3 34.3 0 0 1 13.64 8q5.83-5.8 11.64-11.63c2-2.09 4.18-4.08 6.15-6.22A61.2 61.2 0 0 0 87.2 4.59a64 64 0 0 0-42.61-.38\"\/><path fill=\"#e33629\" d=\"M44.59 4.21a64 64 0 0 1 42.61.37a61.2 61.2 0 0 1 20.35 12.62c-2 2.14-4.11 4.14-6.15 6.22Q95.58 29.23 89.77 35a34.3 34.3 0 0 0-13.64-8a37.17 37.17 0 0 0-37.46 9.74a39.25 39.25 0 0 0-9.18 14.91L8.76 35.6A63.53 63.53 0 0 1 44.59 4.21\"\/><path fill=\"#f8bd00\" d=\"M3.26 51.5a63 63 0 0 1 5.5-15.9l20.73 16.09a38.3 38.3 0 0 0 0 24.63q-10.36 8-20.73 16.08a63.33 63.33 0 0 1-5.5-40.9\"\/><path fill=\"#587dbd\" d=\"M65.27 52.15h59.52a74.3 74.3 0 0 1-1.61 33.58a57.44 57.44 0 0 1-16 26.26c-6.69-5.22-13.41-10.4-20.1-15.62a29.72 29.72 0 0 0 12.66-19.54H65.27c-.01-8.22 0-16.45 0-24.68\"\/><path fill=\"#319f43\" d=\"M8.75 92.4q10.37-8 20.73-16.08A39.3 39.3 0 0 0 44 95.74a37.2 37.2 0 0 0 14.08 6.08a41.3 41.3 0 0 0 15.1 0a36.2 36.2 0 0 0 13.93-5.5c6.69 5.22 13.41 10.4 20.1 15.62a57.13 57.13 0 0 1-25.9 13.47a67.6 67.6 0 0 1-32.36-.35a63 63 0 0 1-23-11.59A63.7 63.7 0 0 1 8.75 92.4\"\/><\/svg><